ploads/origins/ac9e61b9-01ed-4d42-82e0-e910f3fb11e2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=284d6d93fdf296cb235eafd5522294fd 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2c5bf18c/uploads/origins/ac9e61b9-01ed-4d42-82e0-e910f3fb11e2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=500739fda3cea51c63c6e15175d64905 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "VLM様　\n前回はたいへんお世話になりました。\n二度目のリクエストです。\nもしお受けいただけたらとっても嬉しいです。\n今回はすべておまかせでお願いします。\n使用用途は配信画面・アイコンなどです。\nよろしくお願いいたします。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1xNy6g6PMRUgmZK8eLC8lTmseIe-Avxqn?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@vlm_chan/works/9", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/ed3556a2/uploads/origins/d23e00d3-f5c3-4c5d-9e5d-7fa1ae480ab3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=29860c947a8055c4028d01e94c4fd8e0", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ed3556a2/uploads/origins/d23e00d3-f5c3-4c5d-9e5d-7fa1ae480ab3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=29860c947a8055c4028d01e94c4fd8e0, https://si.imgix.net/ed3556a2/uploads/origins/d23e00d3-f5c3-4c5d-9e5d-7fa1ae480ab3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9cddd6a3f477baab96130b1c5dc5b50d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ed3556a2/uploads/origins/d23e00d3-f5c3-4c5d-9e5d-7fa1ae480ab3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3acb09c41196be443ed42770b9a73f51 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello again, I would like to request my character Saphru again. I would like you to draw her in the pose I provided. I would like the expression to match as well. Please keep her wings big, and have her wearing her normal outfit. Thank you! I'm sorry about cancelling so much, I'll be keeping this one up for you. I had an issue with paypal. Thanks for re-sending.\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/xr8Ye4D", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@vlm_ch