\nよろしければVLM様の絵で描いていただきたいです。\n使用用途はアイコン・ヘッダー・配信画面です\n\n自称人間すが、髪の毛が蛸のように稀に動きます。\n自分のことをみんなのお姉ちゃんだと思っていて、ヤンデレ・メンヘラです。\nおだやかにしていますが、その内自己中心的で、暴力的です。\nhttps://twitter.com/zakuro_otoguro/status/1485107583493226498?s=20&t=3S98K7F3BOtmWcJZOgO-zA\nhttps://twitter.com/zakuro_otoguro/status/1502686392778113024?s=20&t=3S98K7F3BOtmWcJZOgO-zA\n\nこんな感じの見下す目が好きです\nhttps://twitter.com/vlm_chan/status/1469934125394325506?s=20&t=3S98K7F3BOtmWcJZOgO-zA\nこの子大好きです\nhttps://twitter.com/vlm_chan/status/1497561485593448449?s=20&t=3S98K7F3BOtmWcJZOgO-zA\n\nポーズなど、お任せします。\nよろしければご検討のほどお願いします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@vlm_chan/works/6", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/1798f7fd/uploads/origins/da43538d-fef5-4f71-b3f7-edc85286fee7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fa9fb27669afaa9ed7d4d3ce96c45bc4", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1798f7fd/uploads/origins/da43538d-fef5-4f71-b3f7-edc85286fee7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fa9fb27669afaa9ed7d4d3ce96c45bc4, https://si.imgix.net/1798f7fd/uploads/origins/da43538d-fef5-4f71-b3f7-edc85286fee7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5dbccd970daa0f557cf7307ab2ef402e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1798f7fd/uploads/origins/da43538d-fef5-4f71-b3f7-edc85286fee7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d72d1da69ff8a9838e0e168e09eef39d 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "初めまして！いつも素敵なイラスト見させていただいております。\nもしよろしければ、私のオリジナルキャラを描いて頂きたいです…！(PSDにラフがあると嬉しいです)\nよろしくお願い致します🙇‍♀️\n\nhttps://twitter.com/su1m1n_jp/status/1481956945125076997?s=21", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@vlm_chan/works/5", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/5b5c04c4/uploads/origins/4c7f5e14-2d37-4c88-9d2f-7e045ed8fa97?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fd3f3c87e7f0e400267d7a0241089703", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5b5c04c4/uploads/origins/4c7f5e14-2d37-4c88-9d2f-7e045ed8fa97?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fd3f3c87e7f0e400267d7a0241089703, https://si.imgix.net/5b5c04c4/uploads/origins/4c7f5e14-2d37-4c88-9d2f-7e045ed8fa97?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=39e0f1b23881f9ac3cbcc0e170d83330 2x, https://si.imgix.net/5b5c04c4/uploads/origins/4c7f5e14-2d37-4c88-9d2f-7e045ed8fa97?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f7de2129a8e4cc16b8d005a43d47fe43 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello again! I Absolutely love the way you drew my character last time, I was hoping you could draw her again! The way you draw the color white is heavenly. I have provided the reference images for her. I would like to have one or both of the expressions I have provided. If possible could you add a version with blood as well? If not, it is okay. I will let you choose the pose for her. This may be a tough request, could you draw her in the outfit I provided in the last image do not add the headphones please. I would like the outfit to be white with silver metal please, no black and no color. Instead of the shorts in the outfit could you give her a long draping cloth like her original outfit, coming down from under her breasts. I will provide an image of what I mean as the last photo.  I look forwards to working with you again!\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/fQsY7b5", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@vlm_chan/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/ba668593/uploads/origins/4c4c7536-a5e2-42dc-8a25-5ddbbb865825?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ac973e52e55ee1886defa801c5f7d0a7", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ba668593/uploads/origins/4c4c7536-a5e2-42dc-8a25-5ddbbb865825?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ac973e52e55ee1886defa801c5f7d0a7, https://si.imgix.net/ba668593/uploads/origins/4c4c7536-a5e2-42dc-8a25-5ddbbb865825?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6d53b059eb32197016d039c4292739a7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ba668593/uploads/origins/4c4c7536-a5e2-42dc-8a25-5ddbbb865825?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e6a6513d172b23d02afba20175fba4c2 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi there, Love your style! I was hoping you would draw my character Saphru, the unholy angel. She is a sadistic killer who hunts humans for pleasure. Please keep her wings as big as the reference if possible, and feel free to add blood if you like. The rest is up to you!\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/znzLFby", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@vlm_chan/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/cd5eec88/uploads/origins/111af0cb-5117-4d48-8b1e-53f25e429e93?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6052f3f04524d72c462c69b30d218f01", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/cd5eec88/uploads/origins/111af0cb-5117-4d48-8b1e-53f25e429e93?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6052f3f04524d72c462c69b30d218f01, https://si.imgix.net/cd5eec88/uploads/origins/111af0cb-5117-4d48-8b1e-53f25e429e93?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8b17443195c8e4fce6e9c19d2437ea39 2x, https://si.imgix.net/cd5eec88/uploads/origins/111af0cb-5117-4d48-8b1e-53f25e429e93?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=32b0edeff69eaf7bdb854600a7055a5d 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは。あなたのアートスタイルが大好きです。私のキャラクターを描いていただけると嬉しいです。彼女はサキュバスで、とても自惚れ屋です。\n参照: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/15mmo0fK625BoqNV4T4vDcoP-LquyaEL5?usp=sharing\n\n牙を見せているようなイメージです。ポーズや表情はお任せします。\n\nありがとうございました。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@vlm_chan/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/d419db9e/uploads/origins/cc1d7044-60d0-4fa8-8e18-153177c93d1c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a12f1b7821084d341425d69efd4a0b88", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d419db9e/uploads/origins/cc1d7044-60d0-4fa8-8e18-153177c93d1c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a12f1b7821084d341425d69efd4a0b88, https://si.imgix.net/d419db9e/uploads/origins/cc1d7044-60d0-4fa8-8e18-153177c93d1c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e9ada51d629435ae21f20f3aea148636 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d419db9e/uploads/origins/cc1d7044-60d0-4fa8-8e18-153177c93d1c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9def56b7a849df22347610e2439920de 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "初めまして、エヌと申します。以前からVLMさんのイラストをツイッター等で拝見させて頂いており、独特な雰囲気が漂うイラストが堪らなく好きです。\nこの度は私のオリジナルキャラクターの全身イラストを描いて頂きたいです。キャラクター001は以前VLMさんが描かれていたイラストのような黒と白の夏っぽい半袖の制服が凄く大好きで、よろしければ似たような感じのお洋服を着せて頂きたいです。(完全に同じでいけないとかではないので多少違っても大丈夫です！)靴等もお好きなように描いて頂いて大丈夫です。また、001が身につけている帽子やロボットは無くて大丈夫です。\nhttps://twitter.com/__killing_me___/status/1325357420248399872?s=21\nキャラクター002はミニキャラとして何処かに描いて頂きたいです。よろしくお願い致します。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-4HRupDf0sn1PB6iPSjaQnq5BBavIqAY", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@vlm_chan/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/4886dc2c/uploads/origins/cce9d519-fce0-4764-93b2-76f972fb3f31?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=185398e8298a37d8b59f7d2423933970", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4886dc2c/uploads/origins/cce9d519-fce0-4764-93b2-76f972fb3f31?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=185398e8298a37d8b59f7d2423933970, https://si.imgix.net/4886dc2c/uploads/origins/cce9d519-fce0-4764-93b2-76f972fb3f31?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=953115fdf18183817ecfc281209d69a2 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4886dc2c/uploads/origins/cce9d519-fce0-4764-93b2-76